NOTE ON EXTERNAL TOOLS

This repository orchestrates third-party tools that are NOT bundled and carry
their own licenses. You must obtain and comply with each separately:

  - Boltz / Boltz-2        MIT        (github.com/jwohlwend/boltz)
  - LigandMPNN             MIT        (github.com/dauparas/LigandMPNN)
  - DiffDock               MIT        (github.com/gcorso/DiffDock)
  - AutoDock Vina          Apache-2.0 (vina.scripps.edu)
  - OpenMM                 MIT        (openmm.org)
  - MAFFT / HMMER          permissive (BSD-style)
  - BLAST+                 NCBI public domain
  - GNINA / MMseqs2 / Foldseek / OpenBabel / PLIP   GPL (2.0/3.0)
        -> separate-process use is fine; do NOT bundle into a non-GPL
           distribution.
  - FoldX                  PROPRIETARY, academic-only: no commercial use,
                           no redistribution (foldxsuite.crg.eu)
  - Rosetta                academic/non-commercial free; commercial = paid
                           (rosettacommons.org)
  - IUPred2A               academic-only, not open source

These do NOT affect the license of the code in this repository (they are
invoked as external processes, never imported or bundled). All GPL/academic
tools are optional with mock / alternative fallbacks. Full audit:
docs/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md

See docs/DATA_AND_WEIGHTS.md for acquisition instructions.
